```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student
    participant Frontend as Browser Dashboard
    participant Backend as FastAPI Server
    participant PromptMgr as Prompt Manager
    participant LLM as LLM Provider (Gemini / Mock)
    participant Parser as Response Parser & Validator

    Student->>Frontend: Paste code + select language (C++, Python, Java)
    Student->>Frontend: Click 'Analyze Code'
    Frontend->>Backend: POST /api/analyze (CodeAnalysisRequest)
    Note over Backend: Validate non-empty code, char limits, language whitelist
    Backend->>PromptMgr: format_prompt(version='P3', lang, code, context)
    PromptMgr-->>Backend: Return hydrated prompt with exemplars & schema
    Backend->>LLM: generate_response(prompt)
    LLM-->>Backend: Return raw response text
    Backend->>Parser: parse(raw_output, language, version='P3')
    Note over Parser: Strip codeblocks, test JSON validity, enforce Pydantic schema
    Parser-->>Backend: Validated CodeAnalysisResponse (0% solution leakage)
    Backend-->>Frontend: HTTP 200 OK (JSON)
    Frontend->>Student: Render Overall Assessment, Severity Badges, Socratic Hints, Positive Feedback
```
